" href=\"/categories/sports\">Sports</a></li><li id=\"38\" class=\"en\"><a class=\"en \" href=\"/categories/arts-theatre-comedy\">Arts, Theatre & Comedy</a></li><li id=\"39\" class=\"en\"><a class=\"en \" href=\"/categories/family-entertainment\">Family Entertainment</a></li></ul>\r\n</li><li id=\"Venues\" class=\"nav-item accessible-megamenu-top-nav-item\"><a class=\"en \" href=\"/venues\">Venues</a></li><li id=\"Help\" class=\"nav-item accessible-megamenu-top-nav-item\"><a class=\"en \" href=\"https://help.ticketmaster.sg/\">Help</a></li>\t\t   </ul>\n\t\t   \t\t\t<ui class=\"nav navbar-nav bottom-nav\"><li class=\"nav-item accessible-megamenu-top-nav-item\"><a class=\"en\" href=\"/login\">Sign In/Register</a></li>\n</ui>\t\t\t\t\t</nav>\n\t\t<!-- start: Breadcrumb -->\n\t\t<div id=\"breadcrumbs-widget\" class=\"container\">\n\t\t\t <ol class=\"breadcrumb\"><li><a href=\"/\">Home</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/activity\">Events</a></li>\n<li class=\"active\">PGL CS 2 Major Singapore 2026</li>\n</ol>\t\t</div>\n\t\t<!-- end: Breadcrumb -->\n    </header>\n\n    <div id=\"main-container\">\n        \n<!-- MAIN CONTENT SECTION -->\n\n<section class=\"event-banner  adp\">\n    <div class=\"large-banner d-none d-sm-block\" style=\"background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5), rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)), url(https://static.ticketmaster.sg/images/activity/26sg_pglcs2major_0c4178e8317b853da23824d6cba3b75c.jpg);\"></div><div class=\"small-banner d-block d-sm-none\" style=\"background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5), rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)), url(https://static.ticketmaster.sg/images/activity/26sg_pglcs2major_2e4a4610953f990ba2c6b3be647d604f.jpg);\"></div>\t<!-- start: page-banner data -->\n\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 col-12\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"masthead-wrap\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"masthead-banner my-3\">\n\t\t\t\t    <img class=\"large-banner-d d-none d-sm-block img-fluid\" src=\"https://static.ticketmaster.sg/images/activity/26sg_pglcs2major_0c4178e8317b853da23824d6cba3b75c.jpg\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"small-banner-d d-block d-sm-none img-fluid\" src=\"https://static.ticketmaster.sg/images/activity/26sg_pglcs2major_2e4a4610953f990ba2c6b3be647d604f.jpg\" alt=\"\">\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t  <div class=\"masthead-text\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"noPadding\"> <span id=\"synopsisEventDate\">10 Dec 2026 (Thu.) ~ 13 Dec 2026 (Sun.)</span> <span class=\"sep\">/</span> <span id=\"synopsisEventVenue\">Singapore Indoor Stadium</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1 id=\"synopsisEventTitle\">PGL CS 2 Major Singapore 2026</h1>\n\t\t\t\t  </div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<!-- end: page-banner data -->\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"whiteNav shadow sticky-top\" >\n<div class=\"container\">\n\t<div class=\"row  align-items-center\">\n        <div class=\"col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 col-12 pt-3 pt-sm-0 order-2 order-sm-1\">\n            <nav class=\"navbar navbar-default d-block\" id=\"edpnavcontent\" >\n                <div class=\"navbar-header g-scrolling g-scrolling-carousel\">\n                    <ul id=\"whiteNavList\" class=\"nav items\">\n        \t\t\t    <li class=\"nav-item\"><a class=\"nav-link \" href=\"#synopsis\">Event Details</a></li>                        <li class=\"nav-item\"><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#prices\">Ticket Pricing</a></li>                        <li class=\"nav-item\"><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#eventfaq\">FAQ</a></li>                        <li class=\"nav-item\"><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#policy\">Admission Policy</a></li>                        <li class=\"nav-item\"><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#others\">Other</a></li>    \t\t\t    </ul>\n    \t\t    </div>\n            </nav>\n        </div>\n\t</div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<div id=\"aboutEvent\">\n\n\t\t<!-- start: announce -->\n\t<section id=\"announcementBox\" class=\"box-shadow pt-3 bg-grey mb-0\" >\n\t\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t  <div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t <div class=\"col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 col-12 mgt-24 pb-4 \" >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"alert alert-notify-purple\">\n\t\t\t\t                       <div class=\"an-bk\">\n                        <span><i class=\"fa fa-bullhorn\"></i> IMPORTANT: Mobile tickets are available for this tour. You can access your tickets via mobile web browser at <a href=\"https://ticketmaster.sg/\" target=_\"blank\" style=\"color:#0000ff;\">Ticketmaster.sg</a>.<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://ticketmaster.sg/mobile-tickets\" target=\"_blank\"style=\"color:#0000ff;\">Learn all you need to know about Mobile Tickets <i class=\"fa fa-external-link\"></i></a>.\u00a0 </span>\n                    </div>\n                                        <div class=\"an-bk\">\n                        <span><i class=\"fa fa-bullhorn\"></i> IMPORTANT: Getting tickets into the hands of fans, at prices set by the artist, is always our top priority. Presale & General Sale queueing for this tour will be via our brand-new Smart Queue technology \u2013 helping keep bots out and giving everyone a fair shot. <a href =\"https://blog.ticketmaster.sg/guide-to/ticketmasters-guide-to-smart-queue-2-21119\" target=_\"blank\" style=\"color:#0000ff;\"> Familiarise yourself with Smart Queue here</a>.</span>\n                    </div>\n                    \t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t </div>\n\t\t  </div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</section>\n\t <!-- end: announce -->\n     \n\t<section id=\"gamelistContainer\" class=\"box-shadow bg-grey\">\n\t\t\n    <!-- start: Container -->\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <!-- start: Game List -->\n          <div id=\"eventListing\" class=\"row pb-3\">\n            <div class=\"col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 col-12 mgt-16 pt-3 pb-3 pb-sm-5\">\n                <h2 class=\"black-heading\">Events</h2>\n                <div id=\"step-container\" class=\"greybody panel-group\">\n                    \n\n                        \n                    <!-- Table View for Single Event -->\n                        <div id=\"single-event\">\n                            <div id=\"step-2a\" class=\"panel panel-default table-view \" style=\";\">\n                                <div class=\"panel-heading\">\n                                    <div>Select your event below.</div>\n\n                                    \n                                </div>\n\n                                                                <div class=\"panel-body\">\n                                     <div id=\"singleEvent\" class=\"gamelist\">\n\n                                                                                    <div class=\"row\">\n                                                <div class=\"col-md-3 col-sm-4 col-xs-12 col-12\"><select id=\"dateSearchGameList\" class=\"form-control\" name=\"dateSearchGameList\">\n<option value=\"\">Select an event date</option>\n<option value=\"10 Dec 2026 (Thu.)\">10 Dec 2026 (Thu.)</option>\n<option value=\"11 Dec 2026 (Fri.)\">11 Dec 2026 (Fri.)</option>\n<option value=\"12 Dec 2026 (Sat.)\">12 Dec 2026 (Sat.)</option>\n<option value=\"13 Dec 2026 (Sun.)\">13 Dec 2026 (Sun.)</option>\n</select></div>\n                                                <div class=\"col-md-3 col-sm-5 col-xs-12 col-12\"><input type=\"text\" id=\"keySearchGameList\" class=\"form-control\" name=\"keySearchGameList\" placeholder=\"Enter search keyword(s)...\"></div>\n                                                <div class=\"col-md-offset-5 col-sm-offset-3\"></div>\n                                            </div>\n                                        \n                                        <div class=\"row\">\n                                            <div class=\"col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 col-12\">\n                                                <div id=\"gameList_general\" class=\"grid-view\">\n                                                    \n                                                            <div id=\"gameList\" class=\"grid-view\"><table class=\"table table-bordered col-xs-12 col-12 mgb-0\"><thead>\n<tr><th>Event Date & Time</th><th>Event Name</th><th>Venue</th><th>Status</th></tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr id=\"26sg_pglcs2major-03e90420\" class=\"text-center\" data-key=\"3239\"><td>10 Dec 2026 (Thu.) 05:00 pm</td><td>PGL CS 2 Major Singapore 2026</td><td>Singapore Indoor Stadium</td><td><a class=\"btn btn-primary text-bold m-0\" href=\"https://ticketmaster.sg/ticket/area/26sg_pglcs2major/3239\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-href=\"https://ticketmaster.sg/ticket/area/26sg_pglcs2major/3239\">Find tickets</a></td></tr>\n<tr id=\"26sg_pglcs2major-a2c50560\" class=\"text-center\" data-key=\"3240\"><td>11 Dec 2026 (Fri.) 05:00 pm</td><td>PGL CS 2 Major Singapore 2026</td><td>Singapore Indoor Stadium</td><td><a class=\"btn btn-primary text-bold m-0\" href=\"https://ticketmaster.sg/ticket/area/26sg_pglcs2major/3240\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-href=\"https://ticketmaster.sg/ticket/area/26sg_pglcs2major/3240\">Find tickets</a></td></tr>\n<tr id=\"26sg_pglcs2major-67fa8b33\" class=\"text-center\" data-key=\"3241\"><td>12 Dec 2026 (Sat.) 05:00 pm</td><td>PGL CS 2 Major Singapore 2026</td><td>Singapore Indoor Stadium</td><td><a class=\"btn btn-primary text-bold m-0\" href=\"https://ticketmaster.sg/ticket/area/26sg_pglcs2major/3241\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-href=\"https://ticketmaster.sg/ticket/area/26sg_pglcs2major/3241\">Find tickets</a></td></tr>\n<tr id=\"26sg_pglcs2major-18072aca\" class=\"text-center\" data-key=\"3242\"><td>13 Dec 2026 (Sun.) 02:00 pm</td><td>PGL CS 2 Major Singapore 2026</td><td>Singapore Indoor Stadium</td><td><a class=\"btn btn-primary text-bold m-0\" href=\"https://ticketmaster.sg/ticket/area/26sg_pglcs2major/3242\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-href=\"https://ticketmaster.sg/ticket/area/26sg_pglcs2major/3242\">Find tickets</a></td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>                                                                                                    </div>\n                                            </div>\n                                        </div>\n\n                                     </div>\n                                </div>\n                                \n                        </div>\n\n                        \n                </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        <!-- end: Game List -->\n    </div>\n    <!-- end: Container -->\n\n\t</section>\n\n\t \t  <!-- start: \u7bc0\u76ee\u4ecb\u7d39 -->\n\t <section id=\"synopsis\" class=\"box-shadow pt-3 bg-transparent pb-4 section-content\">\n\t\t<div class=\"container\">\n            <div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"black-heading mt-3\">Event Details</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"xs-btns\" class=\"d-block d-sm-none col-xs-12 col-12 mb-3\">\n\t\t\t\t\t <div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t <div class=\"col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 col-12\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"additional-button list-unstyled p-0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><a class=\"btn btn-outline-primary col-12 mx-0 mb-2 action-btn\" href=\"https://www.thekallang.com.sg/sites/default/files/2025-11/TKG112025ConditionsofEntrySingaporeIndoorStadium.pdf\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Conditions Of Entry</a></li>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div id='activityContent' class=\"col-lg-9 col-md-9 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 col-12\">\n\n\n\t\t\t\t<strong>Get ready for the first-ever Counter-Strike 2 Major in Southeast Asia!&nbsp;</strong><br />&nbsp;<br />The most prestigious Counter-Strike 2 trophy is officially up for grabs, as the PGL CS2 Major Singapore welcomes us to an intense, four-day live-action finale.<br />The road to the trophy begins with 32 teams, but only the top 8 will navigate the opening stages to the playoffs and compete live at the Singapore Indoor Stadium.<br />&nbsp;<br />Don't miss your chance to see the world's best players redefine excellence on the server. Be part of this historic milestone and witness who will lift the PGL CS2 Major Singapore 2026 trophy!\t\t\t\t<!-- end: \u7bc0\u76ee\u4ecb\u7d39 -->\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<!-- start: Sponsors -->\n\t\t\t\t<div id=\"sponsorSidebar\" class=\"col-md-3 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 sponsor\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"row row-no-gutters\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"left-sidebar-top\" class=\"col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 d-none d-sm-block text-center pb-3\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"additional-button list-unstyled p-0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><a class=\"btn btn-outline-primary w-100 mb-3 action-btn\" href=\"https://www.thekallang.com.sg/sites/default/files/2025-11/TKG112025ConditionsofEntrySingaporeIndoorStadium.pdf\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Conditions Of Entry</a></li>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t            <!-- end: Sponsors -->\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div id=\"disclaimerBox-top\" class=\"row mgt-24\"><div class=\"col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 col-12\"><div class=\"alert alert-notify-yellow\">Please read and agree to all the terms and conditions before placing your order. Purchasing or refunding is treated as fully agreeing to all the rules above.</div></div></div>\t\t</div>\n\t</section>\n\t\t<!-- start: \u6ce8\u610f\u4e8b\u9805 -->\n\t\t<section id=\"prices\" class=\"box-shadow py-4 pb-5 section-content\">\n\t   <!-- start: Container -->\n\t    <div class=\"container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t <!-- start: announce -->\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 col-12 mgt-24\" >\n\t\t\t  <h2 class=\"black-heading\"><a>Ticket Pricing</a></h2>\n\t\t\t\t<div id=\"prices-content\">\n\t\t\t\t <p><span><strong><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\">PRIORITY SALE<br /><br /><span style=\"color: #000000;\">START</span><br /></span></strong><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">25 FEBRUARY 2026</span></span><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><br /></span><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">10:00AM onwards<br /><br /><strong>END<br /></strong>25 FEBRUARY 2026<br />2:00PM<strong><br /></strong></span></span><strong><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"></span></strong></span></p><hr /><p><span><strong><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\">GENERAL SALE<br /><br /><span style=\"color: #000000;\">START</span><br /></span></strong><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">25 FEBRUARY 2026</span></span><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><br /></span><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">4:00PM onwards</span></span><strong><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><br /></span></span></strong></span></p><hr /><p><span><strong><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"></span></span>STANDARD</strong></span></p><table class=\"table table-responsive table-bordered table-hover\"><thead bgcolor=\"#333333\" align=\"center\"><tr><td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"background: #026CDF; color: #ffffff;\"><strong>PRICE CATEGORY</strong></td><td colspan=\"4\" style=\"background: #026CDF; color: #ffffff;\"><strong>DATE</strong></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background: #CCCCCC;\"><strong>10 DEC 2026</strong><br /><strong>(Thursday)</strong></td><td style=\"background: #CCCCCC;\"><strong>11 DEC 2026</strong><br /><strong>(Friday)</strong></td><td style=\"background: #CCCCCC;\"><strong>12 DEC 2026</strong><br /><strong>(Saturday)</strong></td><td style=\"background: #CCCCCC;\"><strong>13 DEC 2026</strong><br /><strong>(Sunday)</strong></td></tr></thead><tbody align=\"center\"><tr><td><strong>General Admission</strong></td><td>$144</td><td>$169</td><td>$294</td><td>$369</td></tr></tbody></table><p><span><strong></strong>Prices may vary by location and availability, and quantities may be limited.&nbsp; All tickets and ticket types are subject to availability and may sell out. Applicable booking fees are not included in the ticket price. These will be displayed at checkout and are as follows:</span></p><ul><li>$6 booking fee per ticket for tickets $50 and above</li><li>$3 booking fee per ticket for tickets between $20 and $49.99</li><li>$1 booking fee per ticket for tickets priced below $20.00</li></ul><hr /><p><span></span><strong>NOTE:</strong></p><ul><li>The availability and types of accessible seating tickets can vary for each show. <br />For inquiries regarding availability, please reach out to Ticketmaster at our hotline: +65 6018 7645.</li><li>Limited to only<span> </span><strong>10&nbsp;<span></span></strong>tickets per transaction.</li></ul>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</section>\n\t\t<!-- end: \u6ce8\u610f\u4e8b\u9805 -->\n\n\t<!-- start: \u8cfc\u7968\u63d0\u9192 -->\n\t\t<section id=\"eventfaq\" class=\"box-shadow py-4 pb-5 section-content\">\n\t   <!-- start: Container -->\n\t    <div class=\"container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t <!-- start: announce -->\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 col-12 mgt-24\" >\n\t\t\t  <h2 class=\"black-heading\">FAQ</h2>\n\t\t\t\t<div id=\"eventfaq-content\">\n\t\t\t\t <ul><li>The Organiser/Venue Owner reserves the right without refund or compensation to refuse admission/evict any person(s) whose conduct is disorderly or inappropriate or who poses a threat to security, or to the enjoyment of the Event by others.</li><li>Ticket holders assume all risk of injury and all responsibility for property loss, destruction or theft and release the promoters, performers, sponsors, ticket outlets, venues, and their employees from any liability thereafter.</li><li>The resale of ticket(s) at the same or any price is prohibited.</li><li>There is no refund, exchange or cancellation once ticket(s) are sold. Upgrade of ticket(s) is subject to terms &amp; conditions.</li><li>We would like to caution members of the public against purchasing tickets from unauthorized sellers or 3rd party websites. By purchasing tickets through these non-authorized points of sale, buyers take on the risk that the validity of the tickets cannot be guaranteed, with no refunds possible.</li></ul>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</section>\n\t\t<!-- end: ibon\u6a5f\u53f0\u8cfc\u7968\u63d0\u9192 -->\n\n\t<!-- start: \u53d6\u7968\u63d0\u9192 -->\n\t\t<section id=\"policy\" class=\"box-shadow py-4 pb-5 section-content\">\n\t   <!-- start: Container -->\n\t   <div class=\"container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t <!-- start: announce -->\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 col-12 mgt-24\" >\n\t\t\t  <h2 class=\"black-heading\">Admission Policy</h2>\n\t\t\t\t<div id=\"policy-content\">\n\t\t\t\t <ul><li>Admission to show/venue by full ticket only. Tickets must be produced for admission.</li><li>Infants in arms and children below <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>4</strong></span>&nbsp;years old are allowed without tickets provided they do not occupy a seat.&nbsp;</li><li>Individuals aged <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>4</strong></span><strong>&nbsp;</strong>years old and above will be required to purchase a ticket for admission.</li><li>Any individual who is <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>12</strong></span> years old and below must be accompanied by a guardian aged <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>18</strong></span> and above, who will be responsible for their safety.</li><li>No outside food and beverage are allowed into the venue.</li></ul>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</section>\n\t\t<!-- end: \u7db2\u7ad9\u8cfc\u7968\u63d0\u9192 -->\n\t<!-- start: \u9000\u7968\u8aaa\u660e -->\n\t\t<section id=\"others\" class=\"box-shadow py-4 pb-5 section-content\">\n\t   <!-- start: Container -->\n\t\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t <!-- start: announce -->\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 col-12 mgt-24\" >\n\t\t\t  <h2 class=\"black-heading\">Other</h2>\n\t\t\t\t<div id=\"others-content\">\n\t\t\t\t <div id=\"others-content\"><p><strong>\u25ba</strong><strong><span>&nbsp;</span>ONLINE &amp; MOBILE:&nbsp;</strong><br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;24 x 7 x 365 days of the year!&nbsp;Visit us on our website at&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><a href=\"http://ticketmaster.sg/\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #0000ff;\">ticketmaster.sg</a></span>&nbsp;to purchase tickets.</p><p><br /><strong>\u25ba</strong><strong><span>&nbsp;</span>HOTLINE:</strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong><br />&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; +65 6018 7645</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Operating Hours:<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Monday to Saturday (10am - 6pm)<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Sunday and Public Holidays (Closed)</p></div>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</section>\n\t\t<!-- end: \u9000\u7968\u8aaa\u660e -->\n\n\t</div>\n\n\n<noscript>\n    <style>\n        .tab-content>div {\n            display: contents !important;\n        }\n    </style>\n</noscript>\n    </div>\n    <!-- AD LIGHT SECTION -->\n\n    <div class=\"banner_space bottom_slot mgt-32 mgb-16\"><script type=\"text/plain\" class=\"optanon-category-C0004\">\r\n\twindow.googletag = window.googletag || {cmd: []};\r\n\tgoogletag.cmd.push(function() {\r\n\tvar mapping2 = googletag.sizeMapping()\r\n\t\t\t.addSize([1024, 400], [[970, 250], [970, 90], [728, 90]])\r\n\t\t\t.addSize([768, 400], [[728, 90], [320, 50], [300, 250], [320, 100]])\r\n\t\t\t.addSize([470, 400], [[320, 50], [300, 250], [320, 100]])\r\n\t\t\t.addSize([360, 400], [[320, 50], [320, 100], [300, 250]])\r\n\t\t\t.addSize([0, 0], [[320, 50], [320, 100], [300, 250]])\r\n\t\t\t.build();\r\n\tgoogletag.defineSlot('/6025/tmsg', [ [728, 90], [970, 90] ], 'bottom-banner-1').defineSizeMapping(mapping2).setTargeting('pagepos','502').setTargeting('page', ['artist']).addService(googletag.pubads());\r\n\tgoogletag.pubads().